    {
      "tier": 1,
      "title": "AlloyDB Omni 的 RPM orchestrator 正式 GA",
      "summary": "Google Cloud 宣布面向 Red Hat 的 RPM orchestrator 正式 GA，与 AlloyDB Omni 18.3.0 一同发布，这套 PostgreSQL 兼容引擎在虚拟机、裸机、边缘和断网环境因此有了非容器的高可用部署路径。公告里的性能表述均为厂商口径。这条路径会带来新的控制平面、角色和备份依赖，评估时应比较 WAL 与 PITR、复制拓扑、fencing 和 pg_upgrade 的实际运维成本。",
      "url": "https://cloud.google.com/blog/products/databases/alloydb-omni-rpm-orchestrator-is-generally-available",
      "author": "Google Cloud",
      "source": "Google Cloud 博客",
      "source_date": "2026-09-09",
      "image": "",
      "domain": "pg",
      "tags": [
        "高可用",
